x = [1; 2];
measurement = [2; 3; 4; 5];
process = [0.5, 0; 0, 0.5];
measurement_noise = 0.1;
process_noise = 0.1;

% Filter the measurements
y = kalman_filter(x, measurement, process, measurement_noise, process_noise);

% Display the filtered measurements
disp(y);
```

