In this program, we first define the URL and the POST data. We then create a client certificate from a PFX file. We create a `HttpWebRequest` object and set its method to "POST" and its content type to "application/x-www-form-urlencoded". We then add the client certificate to the request's client certificates collection.

We then write the POST data to the request stream and get the response from the server. We then print the response status code to the console.

